WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.659 --> 00:00:02.802
Marley was dead: to begin with.

2
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:05.132
There is no doubt whatever about that.

3
00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:10.205
The register of his burial was signed by the clergyman, the clerk, the undertaker,

4
00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:11.601
and the chief mourner.

5
00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:17.211
Scrooge signed it: and Scrooge's name was good upon 'Change, for anything he chose to put his hand to.

6
00:00:17.519 --> 00:00:19.763
Old Marley was as dead as a door-nail.

7
00:00:20.107 --> 00:00:20.799
Mind!

8
00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:26.621
I don't mean to say that I know, of my own knowledge, what there is particularly dead about a door-nail.
